pub const IMAGE_ALT : str = "A dark map of the XC7A200T die in tile columns, with a gold box around the left edge where the design sits, and the same corner enlarged beside it: green LUTs, gold flip-flops and blue carry chains in a few slices next to the IO column. Headline: 60 of 33,650 slices.";
pub const HOOK : str = "A 373-cell design on a 33,650-slice die: see exactly which sites nextpnr picked, then drop your own routed JSON.";
